        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Morodekayi naasaba obukoonyezi bw'Esiteeri",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EST 4:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Morodekayi obuyayetegeriize byoona abikaba bikozirwe, yataagura engoye ze, yajwara eguniya, yayesera iju kandi yagenda hagati y'orubuga, nateera omukungo ogukooto ateireho n'okurra. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EST.4.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EST.4.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EST 4:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yagenda ha mulyango ogw'irembo ly'omukama, kyonka atataahe omunda, habwokuba, hakaba hataroho muntu n'omu anyakujwaire eguniya, ayaikirizibwaga kutaaha irembo ly'omukama. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EST.4.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EST.4.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EST 4:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Omu masaza goona, hoonahoona ekiragiro n'ekigambo ky'omukama ha byahikire, Abayudaaya bakaba omu bujune obutagambwa, baasiiba, baarra, baateera empamo abaakira obwingi omuli bbo, bakajwara eguniya babyama omu iju. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EST.4.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EST.4.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EST 4:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Abaisiki b'Esiteeri n'abakonwa be, obu baizire baamugambira, obujune bwayenda kumwita. Yatwekera Morodekayi engoye z'okujwara omukikaro ky'eguniya baitu uwe yazanga. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EST.4.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EST.4.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EST 4:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nubwo yayeta Hasaki, omu habakonwa b'omukikaali, ayakomerwe kumuroleera. Agende omba Morodekayi ayetegereze ekinyakuroho kandi nkooku kyaizire. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EST.4.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EST.4.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EST 4:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hasaki yagenda omba Morodekayi ow'akaba ali omu ikuute erigalihire ery'orubuga, omumaiso g'irembo ly'omukama, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EST.4.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EST.4.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EST 4:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Morodekayi yamusubirra byona ebyamugweriire, yamugambira omuhendo gwa sente Hamani ezi akaba anihiize kuta omulyaahurro, kakuba Abayudaaya boona baitwa. Amugambe agende asabe omukama, amwesengereze aganyire abantu be. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EST.4.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EST.4.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EST 4:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yahereza Hasaki kopi ey'ekiragiro ekikaba kirangirirwe omu Suusa, nikiragira kuhwerekereza Abayudaaya boona. Morodekayi yamusaba akitwarre Esiteeri, namusoborra ebintu nkooku biri. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EST.4.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EST.4.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EST 4:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hasaki akagenda yagambira Esiteeri Morodekayi ebi akaba agambire. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EST.4.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EST.4.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EST 4:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hanyuma, Esiteeri yabaza na Hasaki, yamugambira ebigambo ebi araagambira Morodekayi, nibyo binu: ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EST.4.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EST.4.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EST 4:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Abaheereza b'omukama boona, n'abantu boona abanyakuli omumasaza g'omukama, bamanyire ngu, kakuba omusaija rundi omukazi agenda mb'omukama omu kikaali eky'omunda, ateesirwe, haroho ekiragiro kimu kyonka kiti; abantu abo baitwege, okwihaho ogu, omukama ou oihireho ogu arayolekeza omwigogwe, habwokuba omu kikaali ky'omukama, oina obusinge okukira abandi boona.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EST.4.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EST.4.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EST 4:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Baagambira Morodekayi ebya Esiteeri yakozire. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EST.4.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EST.4.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EST 4:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nukwo Morodekayi yaragira bagarukemu Esiteeri bati: “Otateekereza omu mutima gwawe oti iwe olijunwa mukikaali ky'omukama okukira Abayudaaya abandi! ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EST.4.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EST.4.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EST 4:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kakuba oculeera omu kasumi nka kanu, Abayudaaya balihuumuzibwa kandi balijunwa ab'omukiikaro ekindi, baitu iwe n'eka ya sso mulihwerekerra nooha amanyire rundi habwa akasumi nka kanu nikyo wafookiire mugo?” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EST.4.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EST.4.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EST 4:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Esiteeri yabagambira kugarukamu Morodekayi bati: ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EST.4.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EST.4.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EST 4:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Irooko ogende osorooze Abayudaaya boona abanyakuli omu rubuga Suusa musiibe kandi munsabire mumale ebiro bisatu; yagenda, yakora byona Esiteeri ebi yamuragiire. Nyowe n'abaisiki bange naitwe nukwo turaakora. Hanyuma y'eki ninyija kugenda mb'omukama nobu kiraba nikicwa ebiragiro. Obu ndafa habwokukikora kanfe.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EST.4.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EST.4.16"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EST 4:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EST.4.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EST.4.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EST 4:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nubwo Morodekayi yarugireho kandi yakora buli kimu ekya Esiteeri yamuragiire kukora.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EST.4.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EST.4.17"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
